* ============================================================
* X64_BROWSER_DISPLAY_SURFACE_AUTO_CANARY.DTS
*
* Purpose:
*   Examine non-mutating browser/reporting surfaces that should
*   obey x64 authoritative names and fallback aliases.
*
* Gating:
*   SMARTLIST
*   SIMPLEBROWSE
*   RBROWSE
*   ERSATZ
*
* Non-gating / excluded:
*   BROWSE
*   BROWSETUI
*   cmd_list.cpp / LIST as a strict policy surface
*
* Scope:
*   Display/reporting only.
*   No WHERE/CALC/xexpr/predicate/index/relation mutation testing.
* ============================================================

SET ECHO OFF
ECHO ===== X64 BROWSER DISPLAY SURFACE AUTO CANARY START =====

DO X64
ERASE VECBROWSER CONFIRM

ECHO ===== CREATE SCRATCH X64 TABLE =====
CREATE X64 VECBROWSER (ABCDEFGHIJK C(10), ABCDEFGHIJL C(10), ABCDEFGHIJM C(10), NORMAL C(10))
APPEND
REPLACE ABCDEFGHIJK WITH "ONE"
REPLACE ABCDEFGHIJL WITH "TWO"
REPLACE ABCDEFGHIJM WITH "THREE"
REPLACE NORMAL WITH "OK"

ECHO ===== BASELINE REPORTING =====
AREA
STRUCT
FIELDS
FIELDMGR SHOW

ECHO ===== SMARTLIST SHOULD SHOW AUTHORITATIVE HEADERS AND VALUES =====
SMARTLIST ALL

ECHO ===== SIMPLEBROWSE SHOULD SHOW CURRENT ROW VALUES =====
SIMPLEBROWSE ALL

ECHO ===== TUPLE AUTHORITATIVE AND FALLBACK ALIAS CONTROL =====
TUPLE ABCDEFGHIJK,ABCDEFGHIJL,ABCDEFGHIJM,NORMAL
TUPLE ABCDEFGHIJ,ABCDEFGH~1,ABCDEFGH~2,NORMAL

ECHO ===== RBROWSE DISPLAY SURFACES =====
RBROWSE STATUS
RBROWSE GRID
RBROWSE TREE

ECHO ===== ERSATZ DISPLAY SURFACES =====
ERSATZ STATUS
ERSATZ GRID
ERSATZ TREE

ECHO ===== CLOSE/REOPEN AND RECHECK CORE BROWSER VALUES =====
CLOSE
USE VECBROWSER
SMARTLIST ALL
SIMPLEBROWSE ALL
TUPLE ABCDEFGHIJK,ABCDEFGHIJL,ABCDEFGHIJM,NORMAL
TUPLE ABCDEFGHIJ,ABCDEFGH~1,ABCDEFGH~2,NORMAL
RBROWSE GRID
ERSATZ GRID

ECHO ===== CLEANUP =====
CLOSE
ERASE VECBROWSER CONFIRM

ECHO ===== X64 BROWSER DISPLAY SURFACE AUTO CANARY END =====
